<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-LEADING WOMEN'S TRAINING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-LEADING WOMEN'S TRAINING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>LAAX, Switzerland 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading women's training</p>
